{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回はたくさんのコメントありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は早く皆さんの前でパフォーマンスしたくてウズウズしてます。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今から皆さんと一緒にスタートを切るのが楽しみです(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早くみんなに会いたいよー(；；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あいたいよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、いたいよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、痛いよー（泣）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は撮影でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ風邪が治りきってなくて、咳が止まらなくて…涙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日辺りから肋骨付近が痛いなって思ってて、今日、集合場所に向かってる途中激痛に襲われ、でも全力で撮影はしてきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影が終わってから、こちらも風邪を引いてるななみんと一緒に病院へ。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心配だったからレントゲン撮ってもらったのね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"咳のしすぎで肋骨が圧迫されて疲労骨折だったらどうしようって思ったけど、特に異常はなくて一安心。(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも筋肉が圧迫されてるって言われたので、今は湿布貼ってコルセット巻いてます（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"い、痛い(ﾉ_･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも痛みに負けず、明日もお仕事頑張るんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"負けるな自分んんんんん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"診察終わってからは、ななみんと少し買い物をしてきました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんいっぱい買ってた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸せそうだった。可愛かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう、ゆったんのブログなによあれ。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"謝られてないんですけどー！\n必死に言い訳してたじゃないか！泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の大好きなドライマンゴー（泣）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その前に、人の鞄を勝手に開けないでください。泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんもいくちゃんも・・・なんでなんよー！（涙）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな私をいじりすぎ！\n悲しいよぉ〜〜〜！泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい！\n明日めっちゃ朝早いので。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい☆彡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくちゃん、れなりん誕生日おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/22/dvc00992.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/22/dvc00991.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん。"}],"source":"archive"}